{"seq":3,"slug":"homological-algebra-in-practice","title":"应用与边界：现代框架、软件与学科分工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/homological-algebra/practice/homological-algebra-in-practice","wordCount":1699,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用与边界-现代框架-软件与学科分工\">应用与边界：现代框架、软件与学科分工</h1><p>前面十一篇把同调代数从动机讲到群与拓扑的具体战场。这最后一篇把视野拉到最广：现代同调代数已经不满足于&quot;在模范畴里取导出函子&quot;，而是升级为导出范畴与三角范畴这套通用语言，渗透进代数几何、K 理论乃至 2025 年的 condensed mathematics 前沿。同时本篇承担&quot;边界说明书&quot;的角色，逐一交代本 hub 与四个相邻 hub 的分工，并给出实际计算会用到的软件工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从导出函子到导出范畴\">核心概念：从导出函子到导出范畴</h2><p>经典导出函子有一个隐痛：要先选分解、再取同调，得到的只是一族孤立的群 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_nF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^nF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，它们之间的精细关系（如复合、对偶）在群的层面很难表达。现代解法是把整条链复形当作一等公民，不急着取同调。这引出两层升级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三角范畴：把&quot;短正合列 + 长正合列&quot;抽象成&quot;好三角&quot;（distinguished triangle）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\to B\\to C\\to A[1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是移位。长正合列的连接同态被移位算子统一吸收，机制见 <a href=\"../foundations/exact-sequences\">正合列</a>。</li>\n<li>导出范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：以链复形为对象，但把拟同构（诱导同调同构的链映射）强行变成同构。于是&quot;分解&quot;不再是外加的手续，而是同一对象在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 里的不同代表，导出函子成了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的真正函子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RG</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ext</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Hom</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Ext}^n(A,B)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{D(R)}(A,B[n])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Ext</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7376em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Hom</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>正合工具</th>\n<th>导出函子的形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模范畴</td>\n<td>单个模</td>\n<td>短/长正合列</td>\n<td>一族群 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^nF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复形 + 同伦</td>\n<td>链复形</td>\n<td>链同伦</td>\n<td>复形上的诱导映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导出范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>复形模拟同构</td>\n<td>好三角</td>\n<td>单个函子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套语言把 <a href=\"../functors/derived-functors\">导出函子</a> 与 <a href=\"../advanced/resolutions\">分解</a> 里&quot;结果与分解无关&quot;的事实，升华为&quot;分解只是同一导出对象的表示&quot;，链同伦的角色见 <a href=\"../foundations/chain-complexes\">链复形与同调</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  HA[&quot;同调代数机器&quot;] --&gt; AG[&quot;代数几何&lt;br/&gt;层上同调 H^n(X,F)&quot;]&#10;  HA --&gt; KT[&quot;代数 K 理论&lt;br/&gt;投射模的分类不变量&quot;]&#10;  HA --&gt; DC[&quot;导出范畴 / 三角范畴&lt;br/&gt;现代通用语言&quot;]&#10;  HA --&gt; CM[&quot;condensed mathematics&lt;br/&gt;Clausen-Scholze 2019+&quot;]&#10;  AG --&gt; Serre[&quot;Serre 相交重数&lt;br/&gt;用 Tor 的交错和&quot;]&#10;  CM --&gt; LTS[&quot;液态张量积&lt;br/&gt;解拓扑向量空间的同调病&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  HA[\"同调代数机器\"] --&gt; AG[\"代数几何&lt;br/&gt;层上同调 H^n(X,F)\"]\n  HA --&gt; KT[\"代数 K 理论&lt;br/&gt;投射模的分类不变量\"]\n  HA --&gt; DC[\"导出范畴 / 三角范畴&lt;br/&gt;现代通用语言\"]\n  HA --&gt; CM[\"condensed mathematics&lt;br/&gt;Clausen-Scholze 2019+\"]\n  AG --&gt; Serre[\"Serre 相交重数&lt;br/&gt;用 Tor 的交错和\"]\n  CM --&gt; LTS[\"液态张量积&lt;br/&gt;解拓扑向量空间的同调病\"]</pre><h2 id=\"代数几何与-k-理论-同调代数的主客场\">代数几何与 K 理论：同调代数的主客场</h2><p>同调代数在代数几何里不是客串而是主力。一个概形 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 上的凝聚层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，其整体截面函子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma(X,-)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 左正合而不右正合——&quot;局部截面拼不成整体&quot;就是那个障碍，它的右导出函子正是层上同调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H^n(X,\\mathcal{F})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0993em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。Grothendieck 1957 年正是为此把整套导出函子理论搬到阿贝尔范畴上。层上同调计算了从曲线的亏格到 Riemann–Roch 定理的一切；平坦性（保证族不坍缩）与 Serre 用 Tor 交错和定义相交重数，都直接取自本 hub 的工具，Tor 见 <a href=\"../functors/ext-tor\">Ext 与 Tor</a>，平坦模见 <a href=\"../functors/modules-projective\">模与投射/内射</a>。正则局部环由整体维数有限刻画，几何上即光滑，这条 Auslander–Buchsbaum–Serre 桥梁见 <a href=\"../advanced/homological-dimension\">同调维数</a>。</p>\n<p>代数 K 理论则从另一角度用同调思想：它把一个环上投射模的同构类信息编码成一列群 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_0,K_1,K_2,\\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 数投射模的稳定分类，高阶 K 群用同伦论方法定义，与群上同调、循环同调深度交织。投射模的基础见 <a href=\"../functors/modules-projective\">模与投射/内射</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿-condensed-mathematics\">前沿：condensed mathematics</h2><p>同调代数的基础在 2019 年后被 Dustin Clausen 与 Peter Scholze 的 condensed mathematics（凝聚态数学）重新审视。核心痛点是：拓扑阿贝尔群（如拓扑向量空间）不构成阿贝尔范畴——核与余核的拓扑会病态，导致无法在其上顺畅做同调代数。Clausen–Scholze 的解法是把拓扑空间替换为 profinite 集合站点上的层（condensed set），使范畴恢复阿贝尔性，从而所有导出函子机器重新可用（据 Wikipedia &quot;Condensed mathematics&quot; 与 arXiv 2024–2025 相关工作）。</p>\n<p>这套框架给出&quot;液态向量空间&quot;（liquid vector space）替代完备拓扑向量空间，并用&quot;液态张量积&quot;证明了泛函分析里长期难以代数化的对偶定理。2025 年的进展包括 Emma Brink 的凝聚态群上同调（arXiv:2512.03648），证明对一大类拓扑群，连续群上同调可实现为凝聚态框架下的导出函子——这直接扩展了本 hub <a href=\"group-cohomology\">群上同调</a> 的适用范围。Clausen–Scholze 还用液态张量积重写了复解析几何的基础，证明了 Serre 对偶与 Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch。这说明同调代数的地基仍在被主动改写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界-本-hub-与四个邻居的分工\">边界：本 hub 与四个邻居的分工</h2><p>同调代数与相邻学科贴得很近，划清边界能避免误读。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>范畴论（<code>24_category-theory</code>）：提供函子、自然变换、极限、伴随、阿贝尔范畴等通用语言。本 hub 直接取用，不重讲；伴随与左右正合的联系见 <a href=\"../../category-theory/core-theorems/adjunctions\">范畴论：伴随</a>。规则是——&quot;通用范畴机制&quot;归范畴论，&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 与导出函子&quot;归本 hub。</li>\n<li>抽象代数（<code>18_abstract-algebra</code>）：负责群、环、模的基本结构与商。本 hub 只在需要时回链，不重新定义；商结构见抽象代数的 <a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/homomorphisms-and-quotients/quotient-structures\">商结构</a>。</li>\n<li>代数拓扑（<code>33_algebraic-topology</code>）：关心具体空间的同调不变量与几何意义；本 hub 关心背后的纯代数机器如何运转，分工见 <a href=\"applications-topology\">拓扑中的应用</a>。</li>\n<li>表示论（<code>32_representation-theory</code>）：与本 hub 在群上同调处交汇，但它的重心是特征标与不可约分解而非导出函子，交汇点见 <a href=\"group-cohomology\">群上同调</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"软件工具-真正动手算\">软件工具：真正动手算</h2><p>同调代数的计算今天大量交给计算机代数系统。Macaulay2 专长交换代数与代数几何，能直接算自由分解、Ext、Tor、Betti 数与同调维数，极小自由分解见 <a href=\"../advanced/resolutions\">分解</a>。GAP 擅长有限群，可算群上同调与群扩张。SageMath 集成上述能力并覆盖单纯/持续同调，是 TDA 与教学的常用平台，持续同调见 <a href=\"applications-topology\">拓扑中的应用</a>。这些工具把本 hub 的抽象机器落成可执行的命令，是从理论走向应用的最后一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>现代同调代数升级为三角范畴与导出范畴：链复形当一等公民，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ext</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Hom</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Ext}^n(A,B)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{D(R)}(A,B[n])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Ext</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7376em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Hom</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>代数几何以层上同调为主力（Grothendieck 1957），Serre 用 Tor 交错和定义相交重数；K 理论用同伦编码投射模分类。</li>\n<li>condensed mathematics（Clausen–Scholze 2019+）重写基础，用凝聚态层恢复阿贝尔性，2025 年扩展到凝聚态群上同调与复解析几何。</li>\n<li>与四邻居的边界清晰：通用机制归范畴论，基本结构归抽象代数，具体空间归代数拓扑，特征标归表示论。</li>\n<li>Macaulay2、GAP、SageMath 把抽象机器落成可执行计算，是理论到应用的最后一环。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同一 hub：导出范畴升级的机制根源见 <a href=\"../functors/derived-functors\">导出函子</a> 与 <a href=\"../advanced/resolutions\">分解</a>；相交重数与平坦见 <a href=\"../functors/ext-tor\">Ext 与 Tor</a>；正则性判据见 <a href=\"../advanced/homological-dimension\">同调维数</a>；前沿扩展的群上同调见 <a href=\"group-cohomology\">群上同调</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：伴随与正合的联系见 <a href=\"../../category-theory/core-theorems/adjunctions\">范畴论：伴随</a>；本 hub 与表示论的交汇见表示论的 <a href=\"../../representation-theory/characters/character-theory\">特征标理论</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用与边界：现代框架、软件与学科分工","id":"应用与边界-现代框架-软件与学科分工"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从导出函子到导出范畴","id":"核心概念-从导出函子到导出范畴"},{"level":2,"text":"代数几何与 K 理论：同调代数的主客场","id":"代数几何与-k-理论-同调代数的主客场"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿：condensed mathematics","id":"前沿-condensed-mathematics"},{"level":2,"text":"边界：本 hub 与四个邻居的分工","id":"边界-本-hub-与四个邻居的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"软件工具：真正动手算","id":"软件工具-真正动手算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"拓扑中的应用：同调代数的诞生地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/homological-algebra/practice/applications-topology"},"next":null}